        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You unleash a wave of emojis. Creatures in the area take 13d6 bludgeoning damage and must attempt a Reflex saving throw.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage and is pushed 10 feet away from you. This is forced movement.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, but the creature takes full damage and is also knocked @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Prone].</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the creature takes double damage and is also @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Blinded] for 1 minute by lingering water droplet emojis.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"
